SUMMARY:The Mule Hosts Asheville Beer Choir!
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Beer Choir is Filling Our Space with Song!\nAsheville Beer Choir is a fun and inclusive group that meets weekly to blend great music\, good drinks\, and a supportive community. Whether you’re an experienced singer or just love to have fun\, everyone is welcome to join in! \nSeptember 17th marks the choir’s second rehearsal for their Spooky Season. \n7pm Sip \n7:30pm Sing! \n Learn More and Join!
