SUMMARY:Bridge 2 Futbol Cultural Community Night
DESCRIPTION:Music\, Soccer\, Culture & Connection\nBridge 2 Futbol is a nonprofit organization dedicated to making futbol more accessible and creating opportunities for players and communities to grow through the game. \nJoin us on September 18th to play mini soccer games on the turf\, enjoy delicious food and music from Mexico City’s BOCAFLOJA. \nFree to attend. All are welcome. Music starts at 8pm \n Connect with Bridge 2 Futbol
